{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access \u2014 <i>Traffic Rivals: 1v1 Duels</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-speed 1v1 street racing through dense traffic. Skill decides everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Traffic Rivals: 1v1 Duels</i> is an intense <strong>street racing game</strong> focused on <strong>lane-cutting, near misses, and pure 1v1 competition</strong>.<br>Dodge real traffic, outplay your rival, take risks, and prove your driving skill in adrenaline-filled duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your car, master traffic flow, and fight your way to the top of the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/fb7e2ba26e920544cb9db7bd99a67bed.poster.avif?t=1774033644\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/fb7e2ba26e920544cb9db7bd99a67bed.webm?t=1774033644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/fb7e2ba26e920544cb9db7bd99a67bed.mp4?t=1774033644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1v1 Duel Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your car, find a rival, and race head-to-head through heavy traffic.<br>Outmaneuver your opponent, create distance, and hold the lead to win.<br>Risky near misses reward skillful and aggressive driving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op &amp; Solo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Mode:</strong> Create a private room, invite friends, and join races instantly from the nearest gas station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Mode:</strong> Freely roam the map, practice driving, and improve your skills at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/e3c3feca0b7a995356716e407d0c4d47.poster.avif?t=1774033644\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/e3c3feca0b7a995356716e407d0c4d47.webm?t=1774033644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/e3c3feca0b7a995356716e407d0c4d47.mp4?t=1774033644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driving Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch instantly between <strong>Standard</strong> and <strong>Drift</strong> driving modes during races.<br>Adapt to sharp turns, tight traffic, and high-speed situations in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/90db9897b251c23bf17ed0e873c8b641.poster.avif?t=1774033644\" width=640 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/90db9897b251c23bf17ed0e873c8b641.webm?t=1774033644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/extras/90db9897b251c23bf17ed0e873c8b641.mp4?t=1774033644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traffic &amp; Environments</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized Realistic Traffic:</strong> Cars, vans, and trucks designed for smooth yet intense lane-cutting gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Maps:</strong> Start from gas stations, race through forests and highways, and experience dynamic day &amp; night cycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access \u2014 Shape the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Early Access and help shape the future of <i>Traffic Rivals: 1v1 Duels</i>.<br>Your feedback directly influences new features, balance updates, and upcoming content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel, master traffic, and rise to become the next <strong>street racing legend</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 Duel Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle customization (visual &amp; basic performance)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard &amp; Drift driving modes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Release Goals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded tuning and customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Market integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved co-op and additional modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New vehicles, maps, and events</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fresh Wheels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3573800/c5bc81cd4fc28e078c1fa57d3727d759000b2284.jpg"},{"name":"Asphalt Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3573800/b08700ed61c210f19c8fb4062543d993caa5f5f5.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3573800/2081a2f2ef142552c2020bb8848f93a885651abe.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Demon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3573800/02d08093e05f6f3c5c1ce405f307d45cd67a4b81.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond Limits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3573800/15a270ae16693ed20763f0d1d1a672ae4664d1fa.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.c