elp shape the future of <i>Traffic Rivals: 1v1 Duels</i>.<br>Your feedback directly influences new features, balance updates, and upcoming content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel, master traffic, and rise to become the next <strong>street racing legend</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 Duel Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle customization (visual &amp; basic performance)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard &amp; Drift driving modes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Release Goals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded tuning and customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Market integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved co-op and additional modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New vehicles, maps, and events</p></li></ul>","developers":["CUBESync"],"ext_user_account_notice":"https://playfab.com/ (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573800/68d0b7aaf1fa79f56e2ed0d1be3a8ddfb3c22a83/header.jpg?t=1774033644","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573800/158043447/23b2dfbb332172350faf4da4bf5ec8f25208ffc2/1768464680/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768592263","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573800/158043447/23b2dfbb332172350faf4da4bf5ec8f25208ffc2/1768464680/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768592263","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573800/158043447/23b2dfbb332172350faf4da4bf5ec8f25208ffc2/1768464680/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768592263","id":257261913,"name":"Traffic Rivals: 1v1 Du